Subject: Cantor Public Procedure Schema Direction Profile

Description: Canonical CPMS addendum separating input-deserialization schemas from output-serialization schemas without duplicating semantic type identity.

@ [specification_uuid] e1c0232a-adc7-4968-aee6-cd3fbfbfd27d
@ [profile] cantor-public-procedure-schema-direction/0.1
